VALUES ('6e63ca9b-de5e-4b06-ac11-715383958c52', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'Quần Âu Ống Suông Dream Pant® — Đen', 2970000, 'Quần Âu Ống Suông Dream Pant® — Đen với sắc đen tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác phù hợp mặc đi làm công sở, gặp đối tác hoặc dạo phố thanh lịch. Made of soft double-knit fabric, the Dream Pant® features an elastic waist, pintuck detailing, and a sleek tapered leg. Plus, it has a flat finish, so it looks polished, but it’s comfortable enough to nap in. The best part? It’s wrinkle resistant. From morning meetings to afternoon errands to late-night lounging—this pant looks (and feels) like a dream.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 132, 4.5, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/26613b89_7dec.jpg?v=1753411432&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/113190b1_8fe1.jpg?v=1753411432&width=900')
