VALUES ('28681857-3bf2-4bb1-a38a-de3148cedd1d', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'Quần Âu Ống Suông Wide Leg Dream Pant® — Đen', 3210000, 'Quần Âu Ống Suông Wide Leg Dream Pant® — Đen với sắc đen tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác phù hợp mặc đi làm công sở, gặp đối tác hoặc dạo phố thanh lịch. Made of soft double-knit fabric, The Wide Leg Dream Pant® features an elastic waist, pintuck detailing, and a relaxed wide leg that hits right at the ankle. With a flat finish, for a polished, but comfortable look, and with its wrinkle resistant properties, these pants are ready to take you straight from morning meetings to late-night (or midday) lounging—this pant looks (and feels) like a dream.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 222, 4.5, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/adae7577_2d47.jpg?v=1753411495&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/14a7316f_d8f2.jpg?v=1753411494&width=900')
