VALUES ('63a6f380-a1d4-48c3-a47d-e156482e8aa5', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'Áo Lụa Mềm Mại Satin V-Neck Maxi Dress — Đen', 1610000, 'Áo Lụa Mềm Mại Satin V-Neck Maxi Dress — Đen với sắc đen tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác tôn vòng eo và kéo dài tỷ lệ cơ thể cho cả công sở lẫn tiệc tối sang trọng. Elegant and versatile, The Satin V-Neck Maxi Dress takes a simple silhouette and makes it magic. Featuring a deep front and back V neck, this sleeveless maxi dress has a flattering dropped waist and neck tie detail to add a little definition. Bra-friendly and easy to throw on, it’s made with a new lightweight hammered FSC-certified viscose which has a slight sheen for a little extra polish.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 105, 4.7, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/43c79917_0d45.jpg?v=1753411620&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/b82b8854_bfb0.jpg?v=1753411619&width=900')
