VALUES ('8a90bb89-9d97-4738-a9a2-a01ad5380fba', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'Đầm Thiết Kế Tôn Dáng Dream Short-Sleeve Dress — Đen', 1970000, 'Đầm Thiết Kế Tôn Dáng Dream Short-Sleeve Dress — Đen với sắc đen tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác tôn vòng eo và kéo dài tỷ lệ cơ thể cho cả công sở lẫn tiệc tối sang trọng. The answer to your dress dreams, meet the Dream Short-Sleeve Dress. Fitted in the bodice, it features a midi-length full skirt with seaming details, slim-fit sleeves that hit just above the elbow, and a center-back zipper. It’s made with our soft, double-knit Dream fabric, for that fits-like-a-dream effect. Easy to wear and simple to style, just add loafers for day, or heels or boots for evenings to give it an elevated edge. This dress is made with a blend of organic cotton and TENCEL™ Modal, a man-made cellulosic fiber extracted from FSC and PEFC-certified responsible wood sources, with a lower water and carbon footprint compared to conventional modal. Lenzing, the producer of TENCEL™ Modal, has achieved the highest rating from CanopyStyle for clean chemistry use and water recycling.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 36, 4.5, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/49a4be42_e3c4.jpg?v=1753411594&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/8934b024_5ce4.jpg?v=1753411593&width=900')
