VALUES ('db6a2837-0cc4-453f-a4ea-3d0b923d044a', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007', 'Giày Boots Cổ Thấp Glove Boot — Nâu Caramel', 2270000, 'Giày Boots Cổ Thấp Glove Boot — Nâu Caramel với sắc nâu caramel tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác dễ dàng phối nhiều lớp (layering) trong tủ đồ tối giản hiện đại. Made of our textured ReKnit fabric, the Glove Boot has a sleek holds-you-in fit and the perfect amount of stretch for all-day comfort. Complete with chic rib detailing, a just-right height, and a walkable heel, this boot fits like a glove and looks damn good. Plus it''s made from renewed plastic bottles (9 per pair, to be exact), so you and the planet can look your best.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 192, 4.5, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/1c78576b_95c9.jpg?v=1769792410&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/ef9698a5_e143.jpg?v=1769792410&width=900')
