VALUES ('793f3acf-e89c-45d0-acf5-8aa14c8069ba', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007', 'Giày Boat Shoe — Xám đá', 3350000, 'Giày Boat Shoe — Xám đá với sắc xám đá tinh tế, đường cắt chuẩn xác dễ dàng phối nhiều lớp (layering) trong tủ đồ tối giản hiện đại. All the comfort of your favorite sneaker, but with preppy boat shoe vibes. Think lace edge detailing with metal eyelets and a bow, in a classic loafer silhouette. Served in soft cow leather uppers or Italian suede. Wear with a bare foot or thin sock (yes, it’s that comfy), and pair with everything from shorts to linen pants to channel that vacay all day mindset.', 'active', 'fe2c137e-8365-42d7-9506-5ae1acfaf0be', 'published', 199, 4.7, 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/f81c4c56_6cfc.jpg?v=1753411773&width=900', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0623/7916/3734/files/61568844_ec85.jpg?v=1753411773&width=900')
